{#- One test case of a suite as a TTCN-3 test case (docs/SCE_TEST_PROFILE.md
    §9.2 E14, §9.5; ES 201 873-1 §26.1): it runs on the component type of
    its configuration's MTC with the configuration's system component type as
    its `system`, maps each MTC port the configuration maps, in document
    order, and calls the MTC's function. `test_case` is
    `ttcn3_export::execution::TestCaseView`. -#}
testcase {{ test_case.name }}() runs on {{ test_case.component }} system {{ test_case.system }} {
{% for m in test_case.maps %}
  {{ m.operation }}({{ m.left }}:{{ m.left_port }}, {{ m.right }}:{{ m.right_port }});
{% endfor %}
  {{ test_case.function }}();
}
